@startuml
actor Reader
participant DocumentPane
participant SldbInspector
boundary GraphApi

Reader -> DocumentPane: open manuscript
DocumentPane -> GraphApi: fetch /api/graph.json
GraphApi <-- DocumentPane: graph payload with support_status
Reader -> DocumentPane: click paragraph block
DocumentPane -> SldbInspector: set active paragraph
SldbInspector -> SldbInspector: reveal section context + note/source chain
Reader -> SldbInspector: click note card
SldbInspector -> DocumentPane: highlight linked paragraph anchor
Reader -> SldbInspector: click source card
SldbInspector -> DocumentPane: keep trace anchored on active paragraph
@enduml